A chat app

A `Client` holds a connection to the `Chat server`, with the label `connect`.
The `Chat server` stores each message in `Messages`, with the label `store`.
The `Chat server` passes each message to `Presence` with the label `fan out`,
and `Presence` gives it to every other `Client` with the label `deliver`. Draw
it as a flow.
---
Client -> Chat server: connect
Chat server -> Messages: store
Chat server -> Presence: fan out
Presence -> Client: deliver
show flow
